er."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translation of her official website profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29143"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0116ef9cb76f06bae3118398a252b1e9c606ac9b66f9ffdb07ea9fab6a1619d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/878413653c165d4bf16a4a875d378761c6e4c026eb78692a739209462f0a0045.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29145","characterName":"早坂 静流","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29145"},"originalCharacterName":"早坂 静流","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"511"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"176"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A good young man who isn't two-faced, Shizuru is Hotori's classmate. Sociable, he possesses the ability to treat anybody without any discrimination. He's not only very popular in his class, but also the entire grade. Hotori admires him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translation of his official website profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29145"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/3665dff4ba20d53a53307769d62f6b5231802a6bcb891e016928f84342a2e6af.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe7254664b25eb08b8487d93f56963a9428a9a542bc7c46863be1a20dbf5ad43.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"KENN","creatorId":"vndb:s372","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s372","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s372","name":"KENN","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71298","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29146","characterName":"ゼン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29146"},"originalCharacterName":"ゼン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"808"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A self-conceited and self-centered young man. Possessing a pompous temperament, Zen has an unshakeable confidence in himself. He seriously believes that there is no shinigami better than him. Zen is actually a very skilled shinigami, however, he sometimes messes up in strange things. Zen's mistakes are all cleaned up by his partner, Rikka. He often visits the Special Supplementary Class members of the Reaper Training School to tease them."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"His full name is Kisaragi Zen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translation of his official website profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29146"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d78c0f0d08449188a9683da40e944d835aa5490fc851d0df364cba857bb2968.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9ad62eab70420f4f9ecd7624324ca518cf4a9ed56a0c090bc9f752caad3b160f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"日野 聡","creatorId":"vndb:s82","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s82","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s82","name":"日野 聡","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71297","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29149","characterName":"リッカ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29149"},"originalCharacterName":"リッカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"918"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"174"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A shinigami who's Zen's partner. Rikka is usually taciturn, though when he does talk, he's very sharp-tongued. He seldom shows his emotions, but he often quarrels with Zen. Since he completes his shinigami jobs coolly, calmly and steadily with precision, he is highly valued in the shinigami world. Rikka secretly settles the disputes Zen causes behind the latter's back. Possessing a thought process colder than everyone else, he thinks it's fine to send all spirits in the world of the living to hell."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"His full name is Minato Rikka. He had worked as Ame's servant when he was alive. Though he was never informed of it, he had a child with Ame's sister Akari, making him Hotori's great-grandfather."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29149"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5239b29e1283e669f8b4b4be5c2c1bac4b7661b9a8a2c65fbbbf3a75a45c119.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/707044f70b08ab8ecbce1948d7969773ff79937d81d1b51495a4bf69a687230e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors"